                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup mcp [OPTIONS] [path]                                     
                                                                                
 Write opentide MCP configuration for editors and agents.                       
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path         -C      <str>  Repository path [default: .]                   │
│ --vscode                      Configure VS Code (.vscode/mcp.json)           │
│ --cursor                      Configure Cursor (.cursor/mcp.json)            │
│ --claude-code                 Configure Claude Code (.mcp.json)              │
│ --generic                     Configure any MCP host (opentide.mcp.json)     │
│ --plan                        List the files each step would write, and      │
│                               write nothing                                  │
│ --yes          -y             Write without asking for confirmation          │
│ --help                        Show this message and exit.                    │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup mcp --vscode --yes
